# B, "dirty": as A until "STOP TYPING.", then Caps Lock, shaking fingers
# (D for S, I for O) and autocorrect finish the job.

title   Launch Room
group   Jay, you, and 3 investors
boss    Jay cobalt
side    Priya lilac
side    Marcus amber
side    Dana mint
pill    Jay is presenting
lead    Investors are waiting. One quick reply by hand.

Jay: The investors are in the room.
Jay: Are we ready to ship?

start
Jay: they're asking right now [0.35]
# A capital W, thought better of.
type    W [panic 0]
wait    0.45
delete  1
wait    0.3
type    Yse, we're deady [panic 0.05-0.5]
wait    0.4
delete  1
# "dead" sits there; reaching for delete again, the finger lands on Return.
wait    0.23
send    slip meant Yes, we're ready
wait    freeze
read
tap     ‼ 0.5
wait    0.75

Jay: what?? [0.3]
type    oh fuck *reayd [panic 0.75-0.9]
send    meant oh fuck *ready
tap     ?
wait    0.2

Jay: ready or dead? [0.4]
type    rea [panic 0.55-0.6]
# It freezes, then takes it back a letter at a time.
wait    0.6
delete  3
wait    0.2
type    yes [panic 0.5]
send
tap     ? ?
wait    0.3

flare
Jay: they can see my screen [0.6]
type    sorry fart fingers [panic 0.8-0.95]
send    meant sorry fat fingers
tap     haha 0.35 haha 0.6
wait    0.35

Jay: STOP TYPING. [0.45]
elbow
wait    0.3
type    I'M SO DIRRY [panic 0.85-1]
autocorrect DIRRY -> DIRTY
send    meant I'M SO SORRY
tap     haha haha ‼ ?
wait    0.3

dots    0.5
wait    0.45
dots    0.7
Jay: Clear your desk. [0.2]
tap     👍 0.25 👍 0.45 ❤ 1.15
wait    0.6

# Caps Lock still on.
type    WAIT NO I MEANT SOR [panic 1]
wait    0.12
end     removed

with
hex     Yes, we're ready. Everything's tested, go ahead.
tap     ❤ ❤ ‼ 👍
Jay:    they're standing up
Priya:  wiring $40M now
Marcus: that was the clearest sentence I've ever read
Dana:   I'm crying
status  Jay made you CEO
Jay:    I quit. it's yours
pill    You're presenting
rename  Bow Before You
effect  confetti
effect  fireworks
score   {hex}, no typos, one company.
typed   Typing: {secs}, {typos}, and one job.
